; whatsapp-web.js depends on full "puppeteer", which normally downloads its
; own Chrome via a postinstall script. That download was unreliably dropping
; chrome.exe on this machine even with antivirus exclusions, so the app is
; configured (electron/whatsapp/client.ts) to use the system-installed Chrome
; via executablePath instead. Skip the download so npm install doesn't keep
; hitting the same broken download.
puppeteer_skip_download=true
